hone charging may prefer a smaller station, and the 100W panel is relatively slow for the battery\u2019s capacity. The panel ships separately, and advertised surge or Power Lifting figures should not be confused with continuous output.","ref_id":{"turn_index":493549,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":12},"pub_date":1786975894.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/0RzV6kQt-P-3EarF4Jidj5ydBZKKM5nsr2xRxFvitjtGa-yKDHiNHT_yv8R-rQBHLGDfseArMoHRJTAW2mJCPiHujR9kjsI89v313LTeg0psLNGINLwOQH7varf5tr5T","attribution":"www.techradar.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"outdoorpowerreviews.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://outdoorpowerreviews.com/best-portable-power-station-under-300/","title":"Best Portable Power Stations Under $300 in 2026","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":493549,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":6},"pub_date":1784937600.0,"attribution":"outdoorpowerreviews.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"tech.yahoo.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://tech.yahoo.com/articles/backup-power-budget-power-station-111500647.html","title":"Need Backup Power on a Budget? This Power Station and Solar Panel Bundle Is Just $56","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":493549,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":7},"pub_date":1773273600.0,"attribution":"tech.yahoo.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.wired.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.wired.com/story/jackery-explorer-300-plus-deal-126","title":"Our Favorite Compact Power Station Is $100 Off","snippet":"The Jackery Explorer 300 Plus portable power station is discounted by $100 at Best Buy and B&H, making it a compact option for preparing for power outages or road trips. Its 288Wh battery can recharge phones and tablets multiple times or keep small appliances running for hours. In testing, connected devices charged at full speed, and a router ran successfully from its AC outlet. Ports include one 15W USB-A, two 100W USB-C port