nected devices charged at full speed, and a router ran successfully from its AC outlet. Ports include one 15W USB-A, two 100W USB-C ports (one also charges the station), a 120V AC outlet rated for up to 300W, and a car-style outlet. For longer outages or more frequent off-grid use, Jackery solar panels are also on sale at Best Buy: the 40W model is $79, down from $130, and the 100W model is $198, down from $299. The article notes that the 300 Plus is best suited to individuals and occasional use, and recommends considering larger-capacity power stations for greater needs.","ref_id":{"turn_index":493549,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":13},"pub_date":1768597817.712,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/iuOyjeNo8nKebknMXKScaVmIJ7wZVH4qNYORtwd7MNjVVxMi-umqgumlRyfPgnKH0ZCXr48sIsMoHaSyUiumxEA95-TquMfhKqqxotoemugTyrzMqELHUjyBjx1TN4tTX4OCF7GtwTYEHiImF4jGRp8CqzpPzQ1GOCmNwoL1ZH5GApf5l4j5M3Lt7huqN8TP568QbgHO7dFV7v7qT8CIfA","attribution":"www.wired.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.outdoorlife.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.outdoorlife.com/gear/best-portable-solar-panels/","title":"Best Portable Solar Panels of 2026, Tested and Reviewed | Outdoor Life","snippet":"","ref_id":{"turn_index":493549,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":8},"pub_date":1711472689.0,"attribution":"www.outdoorlife.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.theverge.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1023173/jackery-explorer-100d-portable-power-station-battery-lithium-iron-phosphate","title":"Jackery made its portable power stations even smaller","snippet":"Jackery\u2019s new Explorer 100D is its smallest portable power station, measuring 4.6 by 3.4 by 3.4 inches and weighing 1.87 pounds. Its 96Wh (30,000mAh) capacity is designed to fit in carry-on luggage and power devices while traveling. The unit uses lithium iron phosphate (LFP) batteries, which Jackery says are engineered for up to eight years 